 Voiced:</strong> Features a cast of talented professional English voice actors who breathe life into the characters.<br><br>💛 <strong>Vibrant and Animated Visuals:</strong> Immerse yourself in the magical city of Castlecoast, brought to life by animated characters, backgrounds &amp; illustrations.<br><br>💛 <strong>Interactive Dialogue Choices:</strong> Your choices influence the characters' actions and will affect the story's ending.<br><br>💛 <strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Listen to beautifully composed music tracks that accentuates the story's most emotional beats.",
